Package: argon-oneup-sensors
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libcap2-bin
Recommends: lm-sensors
Provides: rpi5-kde-sensors-fix
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Description: Argon ONE UP & Raspberry Pi CM5 Hardware Sensors & KDE Integration
 Routes and aliases all physical hardware sensors (CPU thermal, PWM fan RPM,
 NVMe SSD temperature, CW2217 battery telemetry) via standard lm-sensors
 configuration (/etc/sensors.d/argon-oneup.conf).
 Fixes KDE Plasma 6 Systemmonitor ksystemstats ARM64 /proc/cpuinfo deadlock
 (KDE Bug #493093) via private mount namespace and maps cpu_thermal to CPU cards.
